	It occurred to me, while reading a comprehensive list of Psion 3a freeware & shareware, that there seemed to be very little in the way of straight-forward reading material; (H. G. Wells' 'Time Machine' was the only book I noticed).	So I decided to transfer the text of Shakespeare's Sonnets from a HyperCard stack to a Psion .DBF file.	If you like it and would like to see other poems or even Shakespeare plays transferred to .DBF or .WRD format write to me at the following address and I'll see what can be arranged.	Mark A. Tennant,	Porthrhiw,	Capel Betws Lleucu,	Llwynygroes,	Tregaron,	Cardiganshire,	SY25 6SW	Wales.